      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了确认姿势，训练员总会帮我拍下来。\n无论何时，日复一日……真的非常感激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e7c34de7f025efa16f32828866617f39eec96c9697f8bcda090c84ebd69010",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
