      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇～！既柔和又温柔……我觉得非常棒！\n神威小姐好厉害，竟然这么一瞬间就能跳出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "553b5d30e6bc5e7a752902397c823ea205880cd2f8d9734899319d521763e895",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
