      "source_text": "哈哈，命运已经开始运转了！朝着『训练员感谢祭』\n全力奔跑吧！诶，诶，噢———！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10642390d2de8f2510bb8b4a15f680a8966c87d6b0bac23fb037159b2c017467",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
